# Update Help with every feature change

Whenever you add, remove, or change a user-facing feature in Pair Sheet:

1. Update `src/lib/help-content.ts` in the same change (sections, bullets, examples).
2. Set `HELP_UPDATED_AT` to today’s date (`YYYY-MM-DD`).
3. Cover the new behavior with a clear example when it would otherwise be ambiguous (gas totals, sync, holders, intervals, etc.).

Do not ship UI/lib feature work without a matching Help update.
